Voice samples (Resources/Voice/*.wav)
-------------------------------------
The spoken beat-number and subdivision-syllable clips used by the app's Voice
mode were synthesized off-device with Piper, using the voice model:

    en_US-joe-medium  —  OHF-Voice "joe" dataset
    (a male English voice fine-tuned from the "lessac" dataset)

